@baseUrl = http://localhost:5070
@projectId = 1
@documentId = 1
@analysisId = 1
@proposalId = replace-with-proposal-id-from-analysis
@developerId = 1

### Upload a TXT document (the selected project is optional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/files
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=upload-boundary

--upload-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectId"

{{projectId}}
--upload-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="meeting-notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Meeting notes: review the project milestones and next steps.
--upload-boundary--

### Save meeting notes as text
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "title": "Weekly project review",
  "text": "Decisions: review open risks. Next steps: update the delivery plan."
}

### Extract text from a transient attachment (the original is not stored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/attachments/extract
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=note-boundary

--note-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="meeting.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

The team agreed to review the release plan on November 15.
--note-boundary--

### Ask about the current draft and saved notes in a project (requires Azure AI Foundry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "currentNoteId": null,
  "currentTitle": "Weekly project review",
  "currentText": "The release plan will be reviewed on November 15.",
  "question": "When will the release plan be reviewed?"
}

### List all documents and notes, including general records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents

### Search and filter documents by project and type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents?search=meeting&projectId={{projectId}}&type=TXT

### List general (unassociated) documents and notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents?unassignedOnly=true

### List documents and notes for a project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/projects/{{projectId}}

### Read document metadata and extracted text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}

### Download the original file (upload records only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/file

### Edit a note
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": null,
  "title": "Weekly project review - updated",
  "text": "Updated decisions and follow-up steps."
}

### Delete a document or note; its analysis history remains traceable
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}

### Get active developers for assignment selectors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/developers

### Get all developers, including inactive records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/developers?includeInactive=true

### Create a developer without inventing personal contact information
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/developers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Nombre Apellido",
  "specialty": "",
  "seniority": ""
}

### Update a developer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/developers/{{developerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Nombre Apellido",
  "specialty": "Backend",
  "seniority": "Senior"
}

### Deactivate a developer without deleting history
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/developers/{{developerId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Project does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/projects/999999

### Analyze a prepared document (requires Azure AI Foundry configuration)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/analyze

### List persisted analysis proposals for the document
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/analyses

### Accept one proposal, including reviewed corrections; required commitment fields must be complete
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/{{analysisId}}/proposals/{{proposalId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Accepted",
  "correctedProposal": null
}

### Reject one proposal without creating a project record
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/{{analysisId}}/proposals/{{proposalId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Rejected",
  "correctedProposal": null
}

### Verify accepted commitments in the project timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/timeline
